<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="PHP" style="id">- Kwamashi 2022</book>
  <para style="h">FILIPI</para>
  <para style="toc1">Diñoro dya Paulu kwa AkwaFilipi</para>
  <para style="toc2">AkwaFilipi</para>
  <para style="toc3">Filip</para>
  <para style="mt2">Diñoro dya Paulu kwa</para>
  <para style="mt1">AkwaFilipi</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PHP 1" />
  <para style="rem">MN, TC, CC, MN</para>
  <para style="s1">Kuvumenena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 1:1" />Yatwe twa Paulu na Timoti apika Krisitu Yesu. Twaa ñorera akwakutawa wahe o mu Filipi, awa di mwa Krisitu Yesu, mofoci kengeyo natangereri nangamba o kereke.<verse eid="PHP 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 1:2" />Thsihemo no thsiyaro ikare nenu ku tunderera kwa Nyambi Tata wetu na Fumu Yesu Krisitu.<verse eid="PHP 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okanderero no thsirombero</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 1:3" />Naa kandereranga Nyambi wange thsikati thsothsihe o ku ni mi vuruka ko ku mi romberera. <verse eid="PHP 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 1:4" />Naa mi rombereranga thsikati thsothsihe, naa romberanga o ku ni na nyanyuka. <verse eid="PHP 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 1:5" />Naa tendanga kengeyo, inene mwaa kwamena pofoci nange mu ku honga Muthzimbu Ouwa, ku tateka mu diyuwa dyo kutanga shime ku na kuma thsino thsikati. <verse eid="PHP 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 1:6" />Ni na dimuka yoshemwa ci Nyambi oyu naa tateka eyi ekwama yoiwa ku kwenu, kenge a ku i manenena shime ku ka kuma mu diyuwa dya Krisitu Yesu.<verse eid="PHP 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 1:7" />Kwaa ni roera ku ciyuva kengeyo mukaci kenu mwahe pakuninga ci mwahe mu mucima wange mu di thsikati thsothsihe! Inene mwaa ciera nange thsihemo thsa Nyambi, ikare o ku ni di mu kamenga nji o ku ni rwera Muthzimbu Ouwa. <verse eid="PHP 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 1:8" />Nyambi na dimuka ci naa amba yoshemwa, no ku dimuka ci naa mi rura nene mwahe ko thsidirañeke thsa Krisitu Yesu.<verse eid="PHP 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 1:9" />Naa rombera kwa Nyambi ci thsishimo thsenu thsi twarerere ku kura, mudimukero no mu kuyuvithsithsa enu yoihe, <verse eid="PHP 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 1:10" />ci mu twethse ku tawethza yoiwa nene, ci nga mwikare owakenu no kupira kapongonyi mu diyuwa dya Krisitu. <verse eid="PHP 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 1:11" />Mwoyo wenu u yare ima yowawa eyi i piwa ka Yesu Krisitu, ci Nyambi a piwe direma no kushangariwa.<verse eid="PHP 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ku yoya po ka Krisitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 1:12" />Andengenu, naa fota ci mu dimuke ci eyi na i tendahara ku kwange na i kwathsa ku twara ku rupara Muthzimbu Ouwa. <verse eid="PHP 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 1:13" />Mane nakwakunyunga marombe, namweya kengeyo na dimuka nawa ci shime na ni pakiwa mu kamenga pa kwikara mupika Krisitu. <verse eid="PHP 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 1:14" />Pa kwikara kwange mu kamenga, aenthzetu akwakutawa owangi na tanara mu ku kurupera Fumu. Karo ondume wo na u kuru thsikati no thsikati ku honga diywi dya Nyambi ko kupira wowa.<verse eid="PHP 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 1:15" />Ya shemwa ci amweya ku kwo aa honga ya Krisitu ko ku ni tendera mbamba, karo aa fota pohuma dikanyi. Uno honi amweya aa honga keyi yenthzi ko micima thzothzikenu. <verse eid="PHP 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 1:16" />Awa honga ko micima thzothzikenu aa tenda kengeyo ko thsishimo, ko ku dimuka ci Nyambi naa ni pa ekwama yo ku rwera Muthzimbu Ouwa. <verse eid="PHP 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 1:17" />Uno honi awa amba ya Krisitu koñondi, kadi ko micima thzothziwa, aa anekera ci aa ni paka mu dikando uno ni di mu kamenga. <verse eid="PHP 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 1:18" />Kwithsa okaru! Ame po yaa ni nyanyukithsa ci wahe aa honga ya Krisitu, nji aa i honga ko dikuñwa dyo kwithsa nji dyo shemwa, micima thzo shaanga thzo thzikara thzothziwa nji thzothzimango. Karo mukaci keyi kenge na ku twarerera ku roera.<verse eid="PHP 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 1:19" />Inene ni na dimuka ci kerombero yenu no ku kwathsiwa ku Mupepo ou a ni pa Yesu Krisitu, kenge na ku rukururiwa ku mahurerero. <verse eid="PHP 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 1:20" />Naa taterera nene no ku kurupera mu mucima wange ci ka na ku fa honyi, unone kenge na kwikara nondume o ku yara pano eci ekati yoihe ku pa direma Krisitu mwirama yange, ikare o ku ni yoya nji o ku ni na fu. <verse eid="PHP 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 1:21" />Inene ku kwange ku yoya po Krisitu, karo kufa po rukuru. <verse eid="PHP 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 1:22" />Ngeci amepo ni henya ku yoya mu nyama, eyo ku kwange po ekwama eyi ya ku reta ima yoingi. Uno honi ne ine ni hangura? Ka ni dimuka. <verse eid="PHP 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 1:23" />Apo honi ni na kwatiwa kwidi. Ame naa mona ci ku di nawa ku thsia uno mwoyo no ku ka ciwana na Krisitu. <verse eid="PHP 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHP 1:24" />Uno honi mukaci kenu, naa mona ci ku di nawa ci nga naa twarerera ku yoya.<verse eid="PHP 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHP 1:25" />Ko ku tawa shemwa eyi, naa dimuka ci kenge na ku yoya, karo kenge na ku twarerera kwikara nenu ku mi tanarithsa no ku mi retera thsinyanyu mu thsitawo. <verse eid="PHP 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PHP 1:26" />Honi ou na ku keya ku kwenu karo, kenge kwa ku nekara nethsi thso ku cishangarera nene shemwa mwa Krisitu Yesu mukaci keyi a kwama kange.<verse eid="PHP 1:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mu yoye eci anu o mu wiru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PHP 1:27" />Uno honi thsothsikuru mu thsivaka po: Mu yoye ko mukarero ou u na enderera no Muthzimbu Ouwa wa Krisitu, ci shaanga yame ni keya ku na mi mona nji ku yuva pohuma keyi yenu o ku ni na piriko, ci nga ni yuve ci mu na tanara mu mupepo ofoci no ku rwera pofoci thsitawo thso Muthzimbu Ouwa. <verse eid="PHP 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PHP 1:28" />Mwa yapa akwethzimbo yenu, mu tanare micima. Ethsi po thsimonithso kukwo ci kenge a ku nongithsiwa, unone amwe kenge mwa ku yoyithsiwa, karo oko kuyoyithsiwa kwaa tunda kwa Nyambi. <verse eid="PHP 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PHP 1:29" />Inene na mu piwa mukaci ka Krisitu ci mwa tawa pohuma ku kwenthzi, unone karo mu mu nyandere. <verse eid="PHP 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PHP 1:30" />Mwikarupa yofoci tu di twahe. Mwa monine ekarupa yange edi na nyandithsiwire, karo na mu yuvu ci shimbi nekareramo.<verse eid="PHP 1:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="PHP 2" />
  <para style="rem">MN, TC, CC, MN</para>
  <para style="s1">Kucihuthsa kushi nokuru wa Krisitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 2:1" />Ene thsitawo thsenu kwa Krisitu ne thsaa mi tanarithsa nji? Ene mwaa hengawethziwa ku thsishimo thsenthzi nji? Nji mu di no thsiciwano mu Mupepo Oukenu? Ene mu di no thsihemo no ñekeñeke kwanu amweya nji? <verse eid="PHP 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 2:2" />Mweyo, naa mi romba ci mu yarithserere thsinyanyu thsange ko kwikara no muanekerero ofoci, mwikare no thsishimo thsofoci, no kwikara thsofoci mu mupepo no maano ofoci. <verse eid="PHP 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 2:3" />Mwa tenda enu koñondi, nji ko ku fota ku shangariwa. Mu cihuthse kushi, karo mwa anekera ci mwaa pita amweya. <verse eid="PHP 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 2:4" />Mwa mamera yenu pohuma, unone mu mamere neyi yamweya.<verse eid="PHP 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 2:5" />Mwikare noa maano mu kaci kenu, aa ekarire nao Krisitu Yesu.<verse eid="PHP 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 2:6" />Aye, shaanga ci wekarire shemwa Nyambi ku tunda ku matatekero,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:6">ka a shimbire ku cishoka na Nyambi ci thsinu ethsi nga a ñañerera.<verse eid="PHP 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 2:7" />Unone aye keshima yenthzi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:7">wa thsiire yoihe eyi ekarire nayo ko ku citenda mupika,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:7">ko kwerekiwa mu thsikupuro thsonu.<verse eid="PHP 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 2:8" />Wa cihuthsire kushi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:8">ko ku yuvera Nyambi shime ku twara ku kufa,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PHP 2:8">mane kufa ko pa mbinda!<verse eid="PHP 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 2:9" />Mweyo, Nyambi wa mu thzinekire,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:9">mu ndau thzo ku thzinama nene, karo wa mu pire dithzina dyodikuru ku pita mathzina oahe.<verse eid="PHP 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 2:10" />Ci pa dithzina dya Yesu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:10">yumbiwa yoihe yo mu wiru, no mu kaye, no kushi thzo kaye ya ku tongame ku mu remeka.<verse eid="PHP 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 2:11" />Karo madimi oahe a ambe ci Yesu Krisitu po Fumu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:11">ku shangara kutethzima kwa Nyambi Tata.<verse eid="PHP 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tu muneke eci mwethzi mu kaye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 2:12" />Mweyo, ashimiwa ange, eci diya na mu ni yuveranga thsikati thsothsihe o ku ni di nenu, mu tende kengeyo shaanga o ku ni di kokure nenu. Ko kuyapa no ku tutuma, mu kwame ekwama yo ku monithsa kuyoyithsiwa kwenu. <verse eid="PHP 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 2:13" />Inene Nyambi yo na kwamanga mu mwenu ku mi shimithsa no ku mi tendithsa enu yo ku mu roerithsa.<verse eid="PHP 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 2:14" />Mu tende enu yoihe ko kukana ku cithsimoka, nji ko ku kanyeka, <verse eid="PHP 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 2:15" />ci mwikare o kupira kapongonyi no kwikara owakenu, ana Nyambi o kupira kapongonyi mu kaci kanu owamango o rerodino. Mu muneke mu kaciko eci mimunyi mu kaye. <verse eid="PHP 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 2:16" />Mu tanarithse diywi dyo mwoyo ci mu diyuwa dya Krisitu nga na ku wane po ku cishangarera mukaci kenu ci ka na ni ciri mu kengekenge nji ku kwama mu kengekenge. <verse eid="PHP 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 2:17" />Unone shaanga onyinga wange o wa ku viithsiwe eci nupu pa thsiyambero ethsi thsi tupuriwa ko thsitawo thsenu, apo honi kenge na ku nyanyuka nene, na ku ciwane nenu mu thsinyanyu thsange. <verse eid="PHP 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 2:18" />Mweyo, namwe mwaa roera ku nyanyuka nange.<verse eid="PHP 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Timoti na Epafirodite</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 2:19" />Naa kurupera ci ngeci Fumu Yesu waa ku i shime, kenge na ku tuma Timoti ku kwenu wanguwangu ci na ku na tanare mucima ou na ku na yuva keyi yenu. <verse eid="PHP 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 2:20" />Inene ka ni di noyu yumweya o ku ninga eci aye, oyu wa ku pakera shemwa maano keyi yenu. <verse eid="PHP 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 2:21" />Amweya po aa twarera pohuma maano yo athsinda, kadi ya Yesu Krisitu. <verse eid="PHP 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 2:22" />Uno honi amwe po mu na mu dimuka Timoti, inene mwa cimonenine edi a kwamine nange ko ku rurama eci mwana na tata wenthzi o ku tu honga Muthzimbu Ouwa. <verse eid="PHP 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 2:23" />Mweyo, naa kurupera ku mu tuma oko wanguwangu ngeci enu o ya ku ni endere nawa. <verse eid="PHP 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHP 2:24" />Naa kurupera kwa Fumu ci name kenge na ku keya oko wanguwangu.<verse eid="PHP 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHP 2:25" />Naa anekera ci ku di nawa ci ni mi tumene muenthzange mukwakutawa Epafirodite, aye muenthzange mwikwama karo muenthzange dishwarare, oyu mwa tumine ci naa ni kwathseko mwifotahara yange. <verse eid="PHP 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PHP 2:26" />Epafirodite aa fota nene ci naa mi mone mwahe. Aa cinyenga nene pakuninga ci na mu na yuvu ci aa kora. <verse eid="PHP 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PHP 2:27" />Yashemwa shime aa kora, shime ku kokangera. Unone Nyambi na a mu fera ñeke, kadi aye pohuma unone name Nyambi naa ni fera ñeke ci nekara mu mathsiwa oakuru.<verse eid="PHP 2:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PHP 2:28" />Mweyo, naa fota nene ci ni mu tumene oko ci nga mwa ku na nyanyuke ou mwa ku na mu mona karo, name karo naa fota ci mathsiwa ange a pwe. <verse eid="PHP 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PHP 2:29" />Mwa ku na mu tambure ko thsinyanyu eci mwapenu kwa Fumu. Mwaa roera ku pa direma anu o ku cipitura eci aye. <verse eid="PHP 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PHP 2:30" />Inene aye kambe a fe mukaci kekwama ya Krisitu. Na a shuvu mwoyo wenthzi ci a ni kwathse eyi mu na kwanga ku ni kwathsa amwe.<verse eid="PHP 2:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="PHP 3" />
  <para style="rem">ML TC, CC</para>
  <para style="s1">Owawa ko thsitawo kwa Krisitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 3:1" />Ko ku manenena, andengenu, mu roere mwa Fumu. Kwithsa okaru ku kwange ku hukera ku mi ñorera enu yofoci, inene yaa mi nyunga.<verse eid="PHP 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 3:2" />Mu cinyunge kwethzo mbwa, awo anu wetenda yoimango, awa ootera ku amba ci mu thze ku mukanda ci mu yoyithsiwe. <verse eid="PHP 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 3:3" />Yatwe twakwa mukanda o shemwa kadi awo, inene atwe po twaa rombera Nyambi ko Mupepo wenthzi. Twaa cishangara mwa Krisitu Yesu, ka tu kuruperire enu yo ku kwama munu. <verse eid="PHP 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 3:4" />Name ni di neyi nga ni kuruperera ekwama yange. Ngeci kwaa di munu oyu anekera ci o di neyi yoingi yo ku kurupera ekwama yenthzi, ame naa mu pita nene.<verse eid="PHP 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 3:5" />Shime na twariwire ku mukanda o ku ni di no mayuwa mutanu na ahatu ku tunda pa ku shamurukiwa. Name no mwanahoka wa Isiraele o mu mukuta wa Benjamini, no Muheveru shemwa o kuyara. Keyi yo ku hengeka murao o Thsijuda nekarire Mufarithsi. <verse eid="PHP 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 3:6" />Na shimine nene ku nyandithsa kereke, keyi yo ku fota kwikara omuwawa ko ku hengeka murao, nekarire o kupira kapongonyi.<verse eid="PHP 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 3:7" />Uno honi enu eyi na shimbire ci ikuru mu thsivaka, pano naa i mona ci ka i kwathsire thsimweya mukaci ko ku dimuka Krisitu. <verse eid="PHP 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 3:8" />Yoshemwa, naa shimba ci enu yoihe ka i kwathsire thsimweya ku kwange mukaci kodimukero oukuru mu thsivaka o ku dimuka Krisitu Yesu Fumu wange. Mukaci kenthzi na ni tundu kwinu yoihe no ku i shimba ci imango ci nga ni wane Krisitu, <verse eid="PHP 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 3:9" />no kwikara mu mwenthzi. Ka ni cishimbire honi ci no muwawa ko ku hengeka murao, unone ko thsitawo kwa Krisitu, owawa o ku piwa kwa Nyambi ko thsitawo. <verse eid="PHP 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 3:10" />Naa fota ci ni dimuke Krisitu, nokoro o kupinduka kwenthzi kwafu. Naa fota ku nyanda nenthzi no kwikara eci aye mu kufa kwenthzi. <verse eid="PHP 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 3:11" />Kokurupero o kuninga ci name kenge na ku pinduriwa kwafu.<verse eid="PHP 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kucirera ku mamaneneno</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 3:12" />Ka ni ningire ci na ni kumu ku mamaneneno, nji ci no mukwa kwononoka, dyombo! Unone naa twara ku rupara ci ni wane muyambo ou naa nithsera Krisitu Yesu. <verse eid="PHP 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 3:13" />Andengenu, ame ka ni anekerire ci ou muyambo na ni u wana. Uno honi ethsi ni tenda po ethsi, naa thsia yo ku manyima no ku pakera maano yo ku rupara. <verse eid="PHP 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 3:14" />Naa twara ku rupara ku kuma ku mamaneneno ci na ku wane muyambo o ku wiru ou naa nithsera Nyambi mwa Krisitu Yesu.<verse eid="PHP 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 3:15" />Twahe atwe tu na kuru mu Mupepo kweyi enu twaa roera ku anekera kengeyo. Karo ngeci kwa di awa a na anekerera mwamo ku kwenu, Nyambi kenge a ku i mi hokwera nawanawa.<verse eid="PHP 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 3:16" />Shaanga kengeyo, twaa roera ku twarerera ku enda mu dikuñwa omu na tu ende shime ku na kuma rerodino.<verse eid="PHP 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 3:17" />Andengenu, mu ni temunune, karo mu cirongithse kowa a shupwera dikuñwa dyodiwa edi na tu mi monithsa. <verse eid="PHP 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 3:18" />Na ni mi tongwera kare rorungi, pano naa hukera karo ku mi tongwera o ku ni hoyithsa mihothzi ci awa anu aa yoya eci akwethzimbo yo mbinda thza Krisitu. <verse eid="PHP 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 3:19" />Mamaneneno o po ku nongithsiwa, inene dira yo nyambi wo. Karo aa cishangara kenu yo ku fithsa honyi no ku anekera pohuma yo muno mu kaye. <verse eid="PHP 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 3:20" />Uno honi atwe ku diumbo po ku wiru, oku tu na taterera Muyoyithsi ku tundererako, aye Fumu wetu Yesu Krisitu. <verse eid="PHP 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 3:21" />Kenge a ku pirura erama yetu yo ku faratera ku i paka mu kutethzima eci edi i di erama yenthzi, kokoro ou u mu twethsithsa ku reta enu yoihe mushi thzoendithsi wenthzi.<verse eid="PHP 3:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="PHP 4" />
  <para style="rem">ML TC, CC</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 4:1" />Mweyo, aenthzange awa na shima no ku rura, yamwe mwa thsinyanyu thsange no mushukwe wange, mu tanare mwa Fumu, ashimiwa ange.<verse eid="PHP 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Maywi otanarithso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 4:2" />Ewodia na Sintike naa mi adikanena mu ciyuve mwa Fumu. <verse eid="PHP 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 4:3" />Nowe o muenthzange o shemwa owe na kwamanga nange, naa ku romba ci o kwathse awo ambuyama. Inene na ni kwathsa nene mu ku rongithsa Muthzimbu Ouwa wa Nyambi, mofoci kengeyo na Kilementi namweya wahe akwakukwama aenthzange, awa a na ñoriwa mathzina o mu vuka thzo mwoyo.<verse eid="PHP 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 4:4" />Mu roere thsikati thsothsihe mwa Fumu. Naa hukera karo ku amba ci mu roere! <verse eid="PHP 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 4:5" />Mu monithse kuwamucima kwenu kwanu wahe. Inene Fumu pepi a di no ku keya.<verse eid="PHP 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 4:6" />Mwa cithzekera thsimweya, unone mwinu yoihe mu rombere no ku romba kokanderero ci eyi mu fota i dimukiwe kwa Nyambi. <verse eid="PHP 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 4:7" />Thsiyaro thsa Nyambi ethsi thsi na piterera kuyuvithsithsa kokuhe, kenge thsa ku nyunga micima no maano enu mwa Krisitu Yesu.<verse eid="PHP 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 4:8" />Ko ku manenena, andengenu, mu pakere maano kwinu yoshemwa, yo ku remekiwa, yo kuoroka, yoikenu, yo ku roerithsa, yo ku shangariwa, yoiwa nene, neyi yo ku roera ku shangariwa. <verse eid="PHP 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 4:9" />Mu ereke ku tenda enu yoihe eyi na mu cirongithsa no ku i tambura ku kwange, neyi na mu yuvu ku kwange no ku mona o ku ni i tenda. Apo honi Nyambi o thsiyaro kenge a kwikara nenu.<verse eid="PHP 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulu aa kanderera ekunda yAkwaFilipi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 4:10" />Na roerire nene mwa Fumu ci munyima thzo kwikara thsikati thsothsire kwithsa ku ni kwathsa, na mu anekera ku ni kwathsa karo. Kadi cingwa shime mwa ni vuramine, unone ka mwa wanine thsikati nawa thso ku i tenda. <verse eid="PHP 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 4:11" />Kadi cingwa ko i di eyi ni na piri ngeyi ni ambera kengeyo, unone na ni cirongithsa ku rakwa mwinu yoihe omu ni di. <verse eid="PHP 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 4:12" />Ame ni na dimuka kupira edi kwekara, no kwikara nenu yoingi edi kwekara. Na ni cirongithsa dyo ku yoya mwinu yoihe, ikare mu kwikuta nji mu nthzara, kwikara nenu yoingi nji mu kupira. <verse eid="PHP 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 4:13" />Naa twethsa ku tenda enu yoihe ka Krisitu oyu na ni tanarithsa. <verse eid="PHP 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 4:14" />Shaanga kengeyo, na mu tende nawa ku ni kwathsa mwikarupa eyi ni di nayo.<verse eid="PHP 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 4:15" />Karo amwe mwakwa Filipi mu na dimuka ci uya na tangire ku mi retera Muthzimbu Ouwa, ou na tundire mu Masedonia kwithsa kereke thzimweya ethzi thza cierire nange mu kupa no mu kutambura shime thzenu pohuma. <verse eid="PHP 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 4:16" />Mane shaanga uya nekarire mu Tesalonika shime mwaa ni tumithsera ekwathsa rorungi. <verse eid="PHP 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 4:17" />Kadi cingwa naa fota ci ni wane epa ku kwenu ngeyi ni ambera kengeyo, unone naa fota ci amwe mwathsinda mwa ku wane muyambo wenu.<verse eid="PHP 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 4:18" />Pano honi na ni wana yoingi eyi ni na foto yoihe mane ku piterera. I na ni kwana epa eyi na a ni retera Epafirodite eyi na mu ni tumithsera. I nekara eci munuko ouwa o thsiyambero ethsi thsi na tamburiwa kwa Nyambi no ku mu roerithsa. <verse eid="PHP 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 4:19" />Nyambi wange kenge a ku mi pa eyi mu na piri yoihe ko rufumo rwenthzi ro kutethzima mwa Krisitu Yesu.<verse eid="PHP 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 4:20" />Kutethzima kwikare kwa Nyambi Tata wetu diyere na diyere. Ameni.<verse eid="PHP 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kuvumenena ko mamaneneno</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 4:21" />Mu ni vumenenene anua Nyambi wahe awa di kwa Krisitu Yesu. Aenthzange awa di nange aa mi vumenena. <verse eid="PHP 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 4:22" />Nanua Nyambi wahe awa a di kuno aa mi vumenena nawo, thsikurupo o mu mwanda wa Sesare.<verse eid="PHP 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 4:23" />Thsihemo thsa Fumu Yesu Krisitu thsikare no mupepo wenu.<verse eid="PHP 4:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 4" />
</usx>